// Rules for the Japanese documents (overrides .markdownlint-cli2.jsonc).
//
// Japanese prose has no word boundaries, so any column count is meaningless:
// sentences are wrapped by their own rhythm, once written, and re-wrapping by
// width would churn the files without helping readability. The rest of the
// base ruleset applies as written for English.
{
  "MD013": false
}
